@startuml
title Вариант A — failover push → SMS и поздний callback
autonumber

queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Delivery Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Outbox Relay" as Relay
participant "Timeout Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "Push Worker" as PushWorker
participant "Push Provider" as PushProvider
participant "SMS Worker" as SmsWorker
participant "SMS Provider" as SmsProvider
participant "Callback Gateway" as Callback

Kafka -> PushWorker: PushCommand
PushWorker -> DB: dedup + attempt PUSH#1
PushWorker -> PushProvider: send(notification_id, idempotency_key)
PushProvider --> PushWorker: accepted, но app ack не приходит
PushWorker -> Kafka: PushAccepted
Kafka -> Orchestrator: PushAccepted
Orchestrator -> DB: PUSH_WAITING_ACK, next_action_at = +3 сек

Scheduler -> DB: SELECT due FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
Scheduler -> Kafka: PushAckTimeout
Kafka -> Orchestrator: PushAckTimeout
Orchestrator -> DB: lock + version check, status всё ещё WAITING_ACK
Orchestrator -> DB: PUSH_WAITING_ACK -> SMS_IN_PROGRESS + Outbox SMSCommand
Relay -> DB: читает committed Outbox
Relay -> Kafka: SMSCommand

Kafka -> SmsWorker: SMSCommand
SmsWorker -> DB: dedup + unique attempt SMS#1
SmsWorker -> SmsProvider: send(notification_id, phone, text)
SmsProvider --> SmsWorker: accepted + provider_message_id
SmsWorker -> Kafka: SmsAccepted
SmsProvider -> Callback: delivery receipt = DELIVERED
Callback -> DB: callback + outbox
Relay -> DB: читает committed Outbox
Relay -> Kafka: SmsDelivered
Kafka -> Orchestrator: SmsDelivered
Orchestrator -> DB: conditional update -> DELIVERED via SMS

... позднее ...
PushProvider -> Callback: поздний push acknowledgement
Callback -> DB: late callback + outbox
Relay -> DB: читает committed Outbox
Relay -> Kafka: PushDeliveredLate
Kafka -> Orchestrator: PushDeliveredLate
Orchestrator -> DB: state уже DELIVERED, только записать audit

note over Scheduler,Orchestrator
Timeout и callback могут прийти одновременно.
Version/state check разрешает только один переход.
end note

note over PushProvider,SmsProvider
Поздний push после SMS полностью исключить нельзя.
Он измеряется как suspected duplicate.
end note
@enduml
